# Python sidecar working dirs. A local uv/pip venv under docker/agent-memory/ carries a
# lib64 -> lib symlink that Docker's context sender cannot stat on Windows, which fails
# the whole root build with an opaque "file cannot be accessed" — after shipping 144 MB
# of caches nobody needs in the image.
